*.swp

# NOTE: storage/ and logs/ are intentionally NOT ignored.
# storage/memory/*.json and storage/paper_ledger/*.json are the
# real decision history and paper ledger fills -- the actual
# evidence for this project. They must be committed so the
# deployed dashboard shows real data, not an empty state.
